e_currently_open_unit_and_record_the_number_and_size_of_independent_seals","do_not_treat_shelf_life_best_before_sell_by_use_by_sensory_quality_and_food_safety_as_interchangeable_endpoints","bind_any_storage_duration_to_the_exact_product_lot_package_state_temperature_relative_humidity_light_pest_and_contamination_conditions","verify_roast_or_manufacture_pack_and_best_before_dates_for_the_exact_shippable_lot_before_committing_to_a_twelve_month_purchase","verify_the_exact_package_material_barrier_closure_tamper_seal_and_reseal_performance_instead_of_inferring_them_from_can_tin_pouch_or_wrapper_words","do_not_rank_whole_bean_ground_or_instant_coffee_for_one_year_from_format_names_alone_because_the_frozen_corpus_has_no_matched_exact_product_storage_trial","do_not_promote_generic_vacuum_packing_freeze_drying_water_activity_or_rancidification_mechanisms_into_a_product_specific_duration_or_sensory_outcome","require_measured_water_activity_or_other_declared_quality_and_safety_endpoints_when_a_mechanism_claim_depends_on_them","treat_individually_wrapped_tea_bags_and_two_metal_tins_as_unitization_clues_not_proof_of_wrapper_barrier_or_twelve_month_quality","keep_all_four_community_pages_scoped_to_individual_container_questions_and_experiences_not_controlled_coffee_or_tea_storage_evidence","calculate_opened_unit_duration_from_actual_consumption_and_reject_pack_sizes_that_exceed_the_predeclared_opened_quality_window","use_a_small_reversible_calibration_purchase_and_staged_replenishment_or_defer_when_dates_seals_conditions_or_sensory_stop_rules_remain_unresolved","do_not_name_a_universal_format_or_package_winner_for_every_remote_pantry"],"scenario":"A buyer is planning a twelve-month coffee-and-tea pantry for a remote location where replenishment is uncertain. Five exact frozen seller pages offer a three-bag whole-bean coffee, ground coffee in three steel cans, freeze-dried instant coffee in two resealable pouches, loose-leaf tea in two metal tins, and one hundred individually wrapped oolong tea bags. The research set also contains background on shelf life, vacuum packing, freeze drying, water activity, and rancidification, plus four individual community discussions about food-storage containers. It does not contain the exact lots' roast, pack, or best-before dates; package-film specifications; seal tests; measured water activity; the buyer's pantry temperature and humidity record; opened-package consumption duration; or a controlled twelve-month sensory comparison of the five exact products.","target":"Decide what, if anything, can be bought now for the remote twelve-month pantry without turning a format name, seller packaging phrase, generic preservation mechanism, store aggregate, or community experience into an exact-lot freshness guarantee. Audit the five offers in a matched matrix; separate unopened reserve units from opened units; distinguish quality, safety, and date endpoints; verify exact lot dates, package barriers, seals, pantry conditions, servings, and days open; and explain what the shelf-life, vacuum, freeze-drying, water-activity, rancidification, and community evidence can and cannot establish. End with a small reversible calibration, independent-unit rotation, sensory and safety stop rules, a replenishment trigger, and a conditional choice of the cheapest configuration that passes every declared gate, or shorten the horizon or defer if material fields remain unresolved."},"graph_motif":"multi_branch_synthesis","graph_node_to_step_id":{"bridge_community_container_scope":"B1","bridge_format_opening_lot_comparison":"B5","bridge_freeze_dried_instant_scope":"B6","bridge_oxygen_moisture_heat_light_mechanisms":"B2","bridge_seller_format_packaging_claim":"B3","bridge_shelf_life_conditions_endpoint":"B4","bridge_staged_remote_pantry_trial":"B8","bridge_tea_unitization_scope":"B7","decision_evidence_bounded_remote_pantry_rotation":"D1","prop_basilur_loose_leaf_tin_snapshot":"E1","prop_bifl_food_storage_question_scope":"E2","prop_bul